{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「花之戀代言人」洪天明最近再有新話題！他在節目《星二代煮飯仔》中，竟被11歲囝囝洪竟琋（J.T.）大爆驚人秘密，J.T.在問答環節中童言無忌，洩露父親一個尷尬的飲食習慣，更重提「花之戀」經典舊事，令全場爆笑！\n</p>\n<h2>J.T.玩問答遊戲 意外洩露洪天明驚人秘密</h2>\n<p>在節目的家人問答環節中，囝囝J.T.被問到父親洪天明最愛的食物，選項包括花之戀、納豆及辣味食物。J.T.隨即化身小偵探，頭頭是道地分析起來，沒想到在分析過程中，他竟一時口快，意外將爸爸的「不能說的秘密」公諸於世，讓洪天明哭笑不得。</p>\n<h2>J.T.童言無忌爆響口：辣佢鍾意食㗎不過食完會瀨屎</h2>\n<p>在分析答案時，J.T.先是認真地評價辣味食物，然後突然爆出一句驚人內幕：「辣佢鍾意食㗎，不過食完會瀨屎……」此言一出，即時震驚全場！J.T.隨後再提到花之戀，笑說：「可能係花之戀，送咗幾百份畀佢食。」童言無忌的爆料，將爸爸的尷尬秘密和經典話題一次過翻出，娛樂效果滿分。</p>\n<h2>重溫「花之戀代言人」經典 洪天明贏逾20,000件壽司</h2>\n<p>洪天明「花之戀代言人」的稱號源於早年參加TVB遊戲節目《獎門人》系列。當年他在節目中屢戰屢勝，累積贏得超過20,000件「花之戀」壽司，成為香港網民心中的經典集體回憶。沒想到事隔多年，這個經典話題竟由囝囝J.T.在節目中親口重提，再次喚醒大家的記憶。</p>\n<h2>網民笑翻：個仔真係誠實豆沙包</h2>\n<p>J.T.的爆料隨即在網上引發熱議，網民紛紛笑翻。大量留言湧現：「花之戀！回憶返晒嚟！獎門人真係經典！」、「笑死，原來食辣會瀨屎，咁大個人仲俾個仔爆出嚟！」、「個仔真係誠實豆沙包，天明返到屋企點算，哈哈！」更有網民大讚J.T.：「J.T.轉數好快，分析得頭頭是道，好叻仔！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1_3736161216b03c30a1e4bd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1_3736161216b03c30a1e4bd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/7_13997080786b03c3679aae5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/7_13997080786b03c3679aae5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9_10834491466b03c38873456.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9_10834491466b03c38873456.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_15869580746b03c39a37bd6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_15869580746b03c39a37bd6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_10238041126b03c3aedfc3a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_10238041126b03c3aedfc3a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18792646526b03c3bcaba62.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18792646526b03c3bcaba62.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:36:50.476178+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":989,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:22.767821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:27.502155+00:00","content_hash":"7d9be923310ab386fc21e75d99ca85262e18327a07cf6d0f3edc3455aa6cdd91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}